<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are the ministers of a new covenant,</l><l>A cov’nant not of letter, but of the Spirit.</l><l>We are being transformed,</l><l>Transformed in the Lord’s image</l><l>From glory unto glory,</l><l>As from the Lord Spirit.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
